OL,3,CCod army go wild after Fleetwood beat
OL,4,CArsenal on penalties in League Cup
OL,6,FFleetwood Town have pulled off one of
OL,7,Fthe biggest League Cup shocks, beating
OL,8,FPremier League champions Arsenal on
OL,9,Fpenalties.
OL,11,FThe League Two strugglers sent the Cod
OL,12,FArmy wild in the first half when on-
OL,13,Floan teenager Aaron Loupalo-Bi opened
OL,14,Fthe scoring after 21 minutes.
OL,16,FArsenal equalised in the the 50th
OL,17,Fminute through Viktor Gyokeres, who
OL,18,Fscored his first goal of the season.
OL,19,FHowever, the Gunners failed to find a
OL,20,Fwinner on the Fylde coast and were
OL,21,Freduced to 10 men late on.
