OL,3,CCod army go wild after Fleetwood beat
OL,4,CArsenal on penalties in League Cup
OL,6,FAs the Premier League side turned up
OL,7,Fthe pressure without reward, their
OL,8,Ffrustration boiled over when teenage
OL,9,Fprodigy Max Dowman was sent off with
OL,10,Ffive minutes remaining.
OL,12,FMikel Arteta's side were left shell-
OL,13,Fshocked as Fleetwood goalkeeper Jay
OL,14,FLynch made two sublime saves to deny
OL,15,FBen White and Martin Odegaard at the
OL,16,Fdeath, taking the tie to a penalty
OL,17,Fshoot-out.
OL,26,@wD@Vot
