PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1793447290
OL,3,CCod army go wild after Fleetwood beat
OL,4,CArsenal on penalties in League Cup
OL,6,FThere were further heroics from Lynch
OL,7,Fin the shoot-out as he saved correct
OL,8,FArsenal player's name's spot-kick,
OL,9,Fbefore Conor Haughey sparked scenes of
OL,10,Fecstasy at Highbury Stadium by
OL,11,Fconverting the winning penalty.
OL,13,FArsenal lost 5-3 on penalties to a
OL,14,Fside sitting 18th in the bottom tier
OL,15,Fof the English Football League,
OL,16,Fcreating one of the biggest shocks in
OL,17,Fthe competition with Fleetwood's
OL,18,Fmanager Matt Lawlor admitting his side
OL,19,Fhadn't practised penalties.
