OL,3,CCod army go wild after Fleetwood beat
OL,4,CArsenal on penalties in League Cup
OL,6,FFans flooded onto the pitch, players
OL,7,Fswore during their post-match
OL,8,Finterviews, and manager Matt Lawlor
OL,9,Fwas reduced to tears amid the emphatic
OL,10,Fcelebrations.
